WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.346
Nordwind: one real day.

2
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:08.760
Field staff fill in the signed template for the Bremen sailing briefing on an Android phone.

3
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.659
The installation is saved in the account.

4
00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:20.918
Hamburg runs it in the sandbox, with its own Claude plan.

5
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:26.728
The workshop and the harbour office help over encrypted channels. The edge sees nothing.

6
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:33.625
The real briefing comes back to the phone.

7
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:43.637
A real run for Bremen, translated: five dry days ahead, good for sailing.
